# Colour roles are identical across variations; only the values change.
# base = darkest background, primary = dominant hue, secondary = analogous support,
# accent = bright neon edge/glow, highlight = near-white tint for sparkles/rim light,
# pop = tiny complementary spark (<=3% of pixels) to keep each palette lively.
